      "id": "seed-l1",
      "createdAt": "2014-09-17T21:15:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "conv-neville",
      "role": "character",
      "text": "那个……你看见我的蟾蜍了吗。莱福又跑了。",
